<title>USA: AMEX lists options on commodity stock index.</title>
<headline>AMEX lists options on commodity stock index.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said on Monday it listed options on the Morgan Stanley Commodity Related Equity Index, a new index of 20 commodity-related stocks.</p>
<p>The options have initial strike prices of 175, 180, 182-1/2, 185, 187-1/2, 190, 192-1/2, 195, 197-1/2, 200, 205, 210 and 215. Initial expiration months are September, October, November, December and March 1997.</p>
<p>The specialist for the options is Timber Hill Inc.  </p>
<p>Amerada Hess Corp, Baker Hughes Inc, Homestake Mining Co, USX-US Steel Group, ConAgra Inc and Weyerhaeuser Co are among the 20 companies in the index.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
